41538::$$$message_0310_0000_0000$$$::"'Sakura's maid outfit (Left) is in a waitress style.[br]Rider's (Right) dressed as a maid from Tsukihime.'[br]                                                [line len=1]Character Artist."::
41539::$$$message_0310_0001_0000$$$::"Rider's super thoroughbred ponytail is wonderful, but Sakura looks great in that, too."::
41540::$$$message_0310_0002_0000$$$::"Hm."::
41541::$$$message_0310_0003_0000$$$::"Why do you look so eager? There's no punchline.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01d(中)] She's the kind of girl that really shines [move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=565 magnify=1 time=250 my=190 path=(552,200,255,1)(538,208,255,1.179)(516,219,0,1) storage=020_溜息 accel=-2 spline=1]if you compliment her at the right time."[wm canskip=0]::
41542::$$$message_0310_0004_0000$$$::"...I worry for your apprentice's fate.":$�2